flowchart LR
  A[User] --> B[Open Registration Page]
  B --> C[Fill Form]
  C --> D{Client Validation}
  D -- valid --> E[POST /api/auth/register]
  D -- invalid --> F[Show Errors]
  E --> G[Server: Validate & Hash Password]
  G --> H[Create User Record]
  H --> I[Send Verification Email]
  I --> J[Email Confirmation Link clicked]
  J --> K[Activate Account]
  K --> L[Return success -> Login]
